    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just the constant weight of it all. everyone expects me to keep trying, to keep \"fighting,\" but what if the fight is what's killing me? it feels like there's no point in trying to fix something that's just fundamentally broken. i just want to know... is it actually wrong to want it all to just stop? like, is it okay to just admit that i'm done?",
